      464   ASSIGN
      465          FRAME Dialog-Frame:SCROLLABLE       = FALSE
      466          FRAME Dialog-Frame:HIDDEN           = TRUE.
      467   ON WINDOW-CLOSE OF FRAME Dialog-Frame
